M106 S0
;TYPE:Custom
; filament end gcode
; ===== OPTION 1: END G-CODE (CONSISTENT IDLE TEMPS) =====

M117 Print Finished! ; Display message: Acknowledge the print is complete

; --- Retraction and Z-Lift ---
G91 ; Set coordinates to relative mode
G1 E-2 F2700 ; Retract 2mm to relieve pressure and prevent oozing
G1 Z+10 F3000 ; Lift nozzle 10mm off the print

; --- Power Management ---
M117 Cooling Down... ; Display message: Inform user the fans are turning off
M106 S0 ; Turn off part cooling fan
M107 ; Turn off fan (alternate for M106 S0)

; --- Parking Move ---
G90 ; Set coordinates back to absolute mode
M117 Parking Hotend... ; Display message: Inform user the hotend is moving to the front
G1 X0 Y220 F6000 ; Move hotend to the front (X0, Y max) for easy print access

; --- Set Idle / Standby Temperatures ---
M117 Setting Idle Temps... ; Display message: Inform user temps are being lowered but not fully off
; Note: These temperatures will remain until the next print starts.
M104 S190 ; Hotend idle temp (prevents cold ooze, speeds next heat-up)
M140 S50 ; Bed idle temp (prevents thermal shock, quicker warm-up)

; --- Disable Steppers ---
M117 Motors Off - Ready! ; Display message: Final message indicating it's safe to remove the print
M84 ; Disable motors (power off steppers)

; ===== END G-CODE =====
M73 P100 R0
; EXECUTABLE_BLOCK_END

